{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10075","headline":"祀雨师乐章 送神 · 包佶","name":"祀雨师乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"整驾升车望寥廓，垂阴荐祉荡昏氛。\n飨时灵贶僾如在，乐罢余声遥可闻。\n饮福陈诚礼容备，撤俎终献曙光分。\n跪拜临坛结空想，年年应节候油云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}